    "impact": "GET /api/v1/items/ gains an optional case-insensitive `search` title filter (autoescaped icontains) combined with the existing owner scoping. The list/count logic for superuser and normal users was refactored into one shared filter path, and the Items page now has a search box (data-testid=item-search) that re-queries the API and shows a 'No items match your search' empty state. The refactor touches the owner-isolation logic, so regression risk is moderate.",
    "risk": "medium"
  },
